{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（16日）早上10時許，大埔吐露港公路往大埔方向發生2宗交通意外，首先一輛私家車疑失事「自炒」橫亙中線，隨後兩輛Tesla在右線碰撞。據報，3名</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132275448269508608610297.jpeg/-atccipSYZTcKZ-Z3gmQp1THe3J1kW4YugwtHJAMLRw\" alt=\"私家車疑失事自炒，左邊車身及車頭撞至凹陷，事後被拖走。（黃偉民攝）\"><figcaption>私家車疑失事自炒，左邊車身及車頭撞至凹陷，事後被拖走。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132275466334769152074362.jpeg/98ED1zjUAdrBauARCsa-AkoO7dc2n609PnPtFxRz7Rc\" alt=\"兩輛Tesla隨後在右線碰撞，其中黑色Tesla被撞至左邊車頭損毀。（黃偉民攝）\"><figcaption>兩輛Tesla隨後在右線碰撞，其中黑色Tesla被撞至左邊車頭損毀。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><p>現場可見，私家車左邊車身及車頭撞至凹陷，而隨後的兩部Tesla則在左線相撞，其中黑色Tesla被撞至左邊車頭損毀；地上有遺下車輛碑碎片。警方正調查意外起因。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132275469900058624134059.jpeg/e46zt2kmkKrLaMXpvgwxRpPgVku4-strdgZEPFwGRDw\" alt=\"私家車左邊車身及車頭撞至凹陷。（黃偉民攝）\"><figcaption>私家車左邊車身及車頭撞至凹陷。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132275463511871488089243.jpeg/tRODY9EcWISxgjbFz6Yx_14wieEeBbE9tEVowp5FaMI\" alt=\"兩輛Tesla隨後在右線碰撞。（黃偉民攝）\"><figcaption>兩輛Tesla隨後在右線碰撞。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132275460273737728218379.jpeg/sLZn3b9fY3qKOPV3zWN-ZkG28x9CwPSgZ3FUNE1xVDQ\" alt=\"地上有遺下車輛的配件。（黃偉民攝）\"><figcaption>地上有遺下車輛的配件。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132275457387925504146759.jpeg/jlyj2RoOnqXWc3l0i_VDuj8lK6I-d7ZuJc1xnw_NcZ8\" alt=\"警方正調查意外起因。（黃偉民攝）\"><figcaption>警方正調查意外起因。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132284349727641600845260.jpeg/rwaSUYwoaVykvz3IiLG_6G5i01F4UXhMFoFqiBaBaog\" alt=\"自炒私家車車胎幾乎甩脫。（網上圖片）\"><figcaption>自炒私家車車胎幾乎甩脫。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-16T04:10:55.982038+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":326,"images":7,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}